을 아래와 같이 공지하오니 해당기간 내에 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 이수 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2012. 03. 06(화) ~ 03. 08(목)[3일간]</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 대상학생 : 학부의 4학년 이상 재학생</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 대학원 교과목 수강학점 : 학기당 3학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">) 학부과목과 대학원 과목을 합하여 학생의 학기당 수강신청 최대 학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 단, 초과학기자는 학기당 6학점 신청 가능</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 제출장소 : 각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 제출서류 : 학부학생 일반대학원 교과목 이수 신청서 1부.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"HSt